 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "7a3854f2-1e7a-4960-b10c-440d426c4912",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "📊 Original Table (same input for both)\n",
    "\n",
    "| Employee | Jan | Feb | Mar |\n",
    "| -------- | --- | --- | --- |\n",
    "| A        | 10  | 12  | 14  |\n",
    "| B        | 8   | 9   | 11  |\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "🔄 1️⃣ Apply TRANSPOSE\n",
    "Step idea\n",
    "\n",
    "Power Query will swap rows and columns completely.\n",
    "\n",
    "Result after Transpose\n",
    "\n",
    "| Column1  | Column2 | Column3 |\n",
    "| -------- | ------- | ------- |\n",
    "| Employee | A       | B       |\n",
    "| Jan      | 10      | 8       |\n",
    "| Feb      | 12      | 9       |\n",
    "| Mar      | 14      | 11      |\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "What happened?\n",
    "\n",
    "Employee names became column values\n",
    "\n",
    "Months became rows\n",
    "\n",
    "Structure is flipped ❌ (not analysis-ready)\n",
    "\n",
    "📌 Use case:\n",
    "Only useful if you first needed months as rows and then maybe promote headers, clean, etc.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "🔃 2️⃣ Apply UNPIVOT (Jan, Feb, Mar)\n",
    "\n",
    "Step idea\n",
    "\n",
    "Keep Employee fixed\n",
    "\n",
    "Convert Jan, Feb, Mar into rows\n",
    "\n",
    "Result after Unpivot\n",
    "\n",
    "| Employee | Month | Sales |\n",
    "| -------- | ----- | ----- |\n",
    "| A        | Jan   | 10    |\n",
    "| A        | Feb   | 12    |\n",
    "| A        | Mar   | 14    |\n",
    "| B        | Jan   | 8     |\n",
    "| B        | Feb   | 9     |\n",
    "| B        | Mar   | 11    |\n",
    "\n",
    "What happened?\n",
    "\n",
    "Month names became values\n",
    "\n",
    "Sales became one column\n",
    "\n",
    "Data is normalized ✅ (perfect for Power BI / Pivot / SQL)\n",
    "\n",
    "🧠 Side-by-Side Difference\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "| Aspect                  | TRANSPOSE  | UNPIVOT      |\n",
    "| ----------------------- | ---------- | ------------ |\n",
    "| Input                   | Same table | Same table   |\n",
    "| Rows ↔ Columns          | Full swap  | No           |\n",
    "| Keeps ID column         | ❌ No       | ✅ Yes        |\n",
    "| Creates Attribute/Value | ❌ No       | ✅ Yes        |\n",
    "| Used for analysis       | ❌ Rarely   | ✅ Very often |\n",
    "\n",
    "🧩 Final mental model (remember this)\n",
    "\n",
    "🔄 Transpose → “Rotate the table”\n",
    "\n",
    "🔃 Unpivot → “Explode columns into rows”\n"
   ]
  }
 ],
